# Local editor and operating-system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Runtime data from server/server.js (Fase 2) — not source
server/audit.log

# Local copy with the real PORTAL_ADMIN_TOKEN filled in — never commit this.
# Copy INICIAR_API.cmd.example to INICIAR_API.cmd and edit the copy instead.
INICIAR_API.cmd
.env

# Working material that must never reach GitHub Pages. The site is published by
# .github/workflows/pages.yml, which packages everything tracked in the repo —
# so anything committed here goes public. These hold brand material, the
# Comunicação .msg e-mails with employee names, a bookmark export with a payroll
# ID, and the source assets for the card artwork (already embedded in the SVGs).
# They stay on disk and keep working locally; they just can't be committed.
projeto/
skills-lock.json

# .claude/ é conhecimento do projeto e vai versionado: os documentos de
# redesign, as ferramentas e as skills próprias. Ficam de fora as skills de
# terceiros — têm licença própria, são reinstaláveis e somam ~4,3 MB.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/portal-corporativo/
!.claude/skills/dudu-check-cores/
!.claude/skills/dudu-check-modais/
__pycache__/
